lexical.evidence_text:
Only the tyres marked for practice at that Round are permitted to be used and are the only tyres permitted to be taken into Pit Lane ;

For the first Round that an Automobile enters, a maximum of 8 (4 front and 4 rear) new or used dry weather tyres are permitted to be used ;

For each subsequent Round , the number of dry weather tyres is free but only dry weather tyres previously marked into the Tyre Bank are permitted to be used;

For use of New Practice tyres refer to Article 14.3.2;

The number of wet weather tyres is free.

